/","title":"Pañcha Tattva Mantra"},"next":{"path":"/en/hari-nama-mahamantra-sarva-mantra-sara/","title":"Daśa-vidha Nāmāparādha"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":"33/2","no-author":1,"first_line":"hare kṛṣṇa hare kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa hare hare"},"title":["Hare Kṛṣṇa Mahāmantra"],"verses":[{"text":["hare kṛṣṇa hare kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa hare hare","hare rāma hare rāma rāma rāma hare hare"],"translation":["*Illumination by Śrīla Bhakti Rakṣak Śrīdhar Mahārāj:*","Before chanting the Holy Name of Kṛṣṇa, we must first chant the Pañcha Tattva mantra. The Pañcha Tattva, or five features of the Absolute Truth, came to give the Hare Kṛṣṇa Mahāmantra to the fallen devotees of this age, so they are the general representation of Guru for us. They help us to enter into the domain of Kṛṣṇa and also the plane of Śrī Chaitanya Mahāprabhu.","After chanting the Pañcha Tattva mantra, we should count on the beads of the japa-mālā and chant the Mahāmantra.","In the Name of Rāma within the Hare Kṛṣṇa mantra, the Gauḍīya Vaiṣṇavas will find Rādhā-ramaṇa Rāma. That means, “Kṛṣṇa, who gives pleasure (ramaṇ) to Śrīmatī Rādhārāṇī.” In our conception, the Hare Kṛṣṇa mantra is wholesale Kṛṣṇa consciousness, not Rāma (Lord Rāmachandra) consciousness. Śrī Chaitanya’s highest conception of things is always Svayaṁ Bhagavān, Kṛṣṇa-līlā, Rādhā-Govinda-līlā. That is the real purpose of Śrī Chaitanya Mahāprabhu’s advent and teachings. In that consideration, the Hare Kṛṣṇa mantra does not mention the Rāma-līlā of Āyodhya at all. There is no connection with that in the highest conception of the Hare Kṛṣṇa mantra. The inner conception of the mantra is responsible for our spiritual attainment. The inner conception of the devotee will guide them to their destination."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/scs-math-mexico-cpi/mahamantra-hare-krishna-srila-bhakti-rakshak-sridhar-deva-goswami-maharaj","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/maha-mantra","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/mahamantra-kirttan","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/maha-mantra-bhoga","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/maha-mantra-evening-tune","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/maha-mantra-gaura-arati","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/maha-mantra-jaya-radhe","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/maha-mantra-nabadwip-tune-3","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/maha-mantra-ohe-harinama","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/mahamantrasudha","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/mahamantrasware","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Hare-Krishna-mahāmantra-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/hare-krishna-hare-krishna-krishna-krishna-hare-hare/","description":"hare kṛṣṇa hare kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa hare hare. Hare Kṛṣṇa Mahāmantra — a Vaiṣṇava song with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Hare Kṛṣṇa Mahāmantra | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"hare-krishna-hare-krishna-krishna-krishna-hare-hare"